   "title": "Price movers, week of October 19",
   "html": "<p>The biggest riser this week was Magister Sphinx (Double Masters 2022), up 182 percent to $10.11. The steepest fall was Thunderhawk Gunship (Warhammer 40,000 Commander), down 39 percent to $8.14. A price is a listing price, not an offer, and a week is a short window: treat a spike as a question, not an answer.</p>\n<p><strong>Biggest risers</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>Magister Sphinx</strong> (Double Masters 2022): $3.59 to $10.11, +182%</li><li><strong>Dark Matter Manipulator</strong> (Reality Fracture): $1.13 to $2.70, +139%</li><li><strong>Uthros Research Craft</strong> (Edge of Eternities Commander): $1.54 to $2.67, +74%</li><li><strong>Vraska, Betrayal&#x27;s Sting</strong> (Lorwyn Eclipsed Commander): $3.02 to $4.79, +58%</li><li><strong>Agatha of the Vile Cauldron</strong> (Wilds of Eldraine): $6.75 to $10.58, +57%</li><li><strong>Astral Dragon</strong> (Commander Legends: Battle for Baldur&#x27;s Gate): $24.27 to $35.00, +44%</li><li><strong>Archfiend of Despair</strong> (Reality Fracture Commander): $3.30 to $4.66, +41%</li><li><strong>Radiant Solar</strong> (Forgotten Realms Commander): $3.92 to $5.54, +41%</li><li><strong>Mila, Crafty Companion // Lukka, Wayward Bonder</strong> (Strixhaven: School of Mages): $2.96 to $4.13, +40%</li><li><strong>Secret Tunnel</strong> (Avatar: The Last Airbender): $2.67 to $3.72, +39%</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Biggest fallers</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong>Thunderhawk Gunship</strong> (Warhammer 40,000 Commander): $13.28 to $8.14, -39%</li><li><strong>Dwarven Miner</strong> (Mirage): $3.45 to $2.17, -37%</li><li><strong>Bottle-Cap Blast</strong> (Fallout): $3.52 to $2.24, -36%</li><li><strong>Black Widow, Agile Avenger</strong> (Marvel Super Heroes Commander): $5.69 to $3.67, -35%</li><li><strong>Samut, Tyrant of Naktamun</strong> (Reality Fracture): $10.05 to $6.55, -35%</li><li><strong>Flawless Maneuver</strong> (Commander 2020): $21.93 to $14.45, -34%</li><li><strong>Nest of Scarabs</strong> (Amonkhet): $4.84